{
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_SUPPLY_CACHE.title": "冻土补给箱",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_SUPPLY_CACHE.pages.INITIAL.description": "积雪的小巷尽头，堆着一批被[orange]整合运动[/orange]遗弃的补给箱。几只木箱已经被人撬开过，剩下的口粮和弹药还冻在里面。\n\n最里面那只[gold]铁箱[/gold]挂着一把大锁，锁上的霜还没有人碰过。\n\n远处的黑暗里，好像有什么东西在[jitter]喘气[/jitter]。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_SUPPLY_CACHE.pages.INITIAL.options.RATIONS.title": "拿走口粮",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_SUPPLY_CACHE.pages.INITIAL.options.RATIONS.description": "回复[green]18[/green]点生命。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_SUPPLY_CACHE.pages.INITIAL.options.AMMO.title": "翻找弹药",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_SUPPLY_CACHE.pages.INITIAL.options.AMMO.description": "从[blue]3[/blue]张攻击牌中选择[blue]1[/blue]张加入你的[gold]牌组[/gold]。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_SUPPLY_CACHE.pages.INITIAL.options.PRY.title": "撬开铁箱",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_SUPPLY_CACHE.pages.INITIAL.options.PRY.description": "与[red]游击队猎犬[/red]战斗。获胜后额外获得[blue]75[/blue][gold]金币[/gold]。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_SUPPLY_CACHE.pages.RATIONS.description": "冻得梆硬的罐头和压缩饼干。你就着雪水吃了一顿怎么也热不起来的饭，但总算[green]缓过劲来[/green]。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_SUPPLY_CACHE.pages.AMMO.description": "弹药袋里除了子弹，还夹着一本写满[gold]战术笔记[/gold]的小册子，字迹潦草，却很实用。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_GUERRILLA_CAMPFIRE.title": "游击队的篝火",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_GUERRILLA_CAMPFIRE.pages.INITIAL.description": "几堵断墙挡住了风雪，一小堆[orange]篝火[/orange]噼啪作响。围坐在火边的是几名裹着厚斗篷的游击队老兵，一面伤痕累累的[gold]大盾[/gold]靠在墙边。\n\n他们看了你一眼，没有拔刀。其中一人往火里添了块木头，示意你坐下。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_GUERRILLA_CAMPFIRE.pages.INITIAL.options.SHARE.title": "分享食物",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_GUERRILLA_CAMPFIRE.pages.INITIAL.options.SHARE.description": "花费[blue]50[/blue][gold]金币[/gold]。最大生命值+[green]8[/green]。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_GUERRILLA_CAMPFIRE.pages.INITIAL.options.SHARE_LOCKED.title": "已锁定",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_GUERRILLA_CAMPFIRE.pages.INITIAL.options.SHARE_LOCKED.description": "需要[blue]50[/blue][gold]金币[/gold]。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_GUERRILLA_CAMPFIRE.pages.INITIAL.options.LISTEN.title": "听老兵讲过去",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_GUERRILLA_CAMPFIRE.pages.INITIAL.options.LISTEN.description": "[gold]升级[/gold]一张牌。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_GUERRILLA_CAMPFIRE.pages.INITIAL.options.LEAVE.title": "悄悄离开",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_GUERRILLA_CAMPFIRE.pages.INITIAL.options.LEAVE.description": "什么也不做。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_GUERRILLA_CAMPFIRE.pages.SHARE.description": "你把带来的物资分给了他们。锅里的汤很稀，但每个人都分到了一碗。\n\n老兵们说起在冻原上行军的日子——那时候，他们的长官总是[gold]最后一个[/gold]吃饭。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_GUERRILLA_CAMPFIRE.pages.LISTEN.description": "老兵讲起一场雪原上的阻击战：怎么用盾墙挡住铳弹，怎么在队伍溃散之前再撑一轮。\n\n你默默记下了其中的[gold]诀窍[/gold]。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_GUERRILLA_CAMPFIRE.pages.LEAVE.description": "你没有打扰他们，悄悄绕开了火光。身后传来一阵低低的[sine]歌声[/sine]。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_ORIGINIUM_VEIN.title": "源石矿脉",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_ORIGINIUM_VEIN.pages.INITIAL.description": "管道隧道的墙壁裂开了，一大簇黑色的[orange]源石结晶[/orange]从钢板缝里刺出来，裂纹里透着[orange][sine]琥珀色的光[/sine][/orange]。\n\n地上丢着一把矿镐，镐柄上缠着的布已经发黑。你知道徒手碰它意味着什么。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_ORIGINIUM_VEIN.pages.INITIAL.options.TOUCH.title": "触碰结晶",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_ORIGINIUM_VEIN.pages.INITIAL.options.TOUCH.description": "从[blue]3[/blue]张[gold]稀有[/gold]牌中选择[blue]1[/blue]张加入你的[gold]牌组[/gold]。将一张[red]矿石病[/red]加入你的[gold]牌组[/gold]。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_ORIGINIUM_VEIN.pages.INITIAL.options.MINE.title": "开采",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_ORIGINIUM_VEIN.pages.INITIAL.options.MINE.description": "失去[red]9[/red]点生命。获得[blue]85[/blue][gold]金币[/gold]。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_ORIGINIUM_VEIN.pages.INITIAL.options.MINE_LOCKED.title": "已锁定",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_ORIGINIUM_VEIN.pages.INITIAL.options.MINE_LOCKED.description": "你的生命值太低了。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_ORIGINIUM_VEIN.pages.INITIAL.options.LEAVE.title": "离开",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_ORIGINIUM_VEIN.pages.INITIAL.options.LEAVE.description": "什么也不做。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_ORIGINIUM_VEIN.pages.TOUCH.description": "结晶在你掌心里是温热的。一阵[jitter]刺痛[/jitter]过后，脑海里多了些不属于你的东西。\n\n手背上，一粒黑色的[red]结晶[/red]悄悄冒了出来。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_ORIGINIUM_VEIN.pages.MINE.description": "你用布裹住手，一镐一镐地把碎晶敲下来。碎屑划破了手臂，但这些结晶在黑市上[gold]很值钱[/gold]。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_ORIGINIUM_VEIN.pages.LEAVE.description": "你退后几步，绕开了这片结晶。有些东西，最好永远别碰。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_CORE_VALVE.title": "核心城动力阀",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_CORE_VALVE.pages.INITIAL.description": "引擎舱深处，一只巨大的[gold]阀门手轮[/gold]卡在管道汇合处，接缝里嘶嘶地喷着[sine]蒸汽[/sine]。上方的[red]警示灯[/red]一直在闪，压力表的指针早已顶到了尽头。\n\n这座移动城市还在前进，而它的心脏快要撑不住了。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_CORE_VALVE.pages.INITIAL.options.VENT.title": "手动泄压",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_CORE_VALVE.pages.INITIAL.options.VENT.description": "失去[red]7[/red]点生命。从你的[gold]牌组[/gold]中移除一张牌。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_CORE_VALVE.pages.INITIAL.options.VENT_LOCKED.title": "已锁定",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_CORE_VALVE.pages.INITIAL.options.VENT_LOCKED.description": "你的生命值太低，或没有可以移除的牌。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_CORE_VALVE.pages.INITIAL.options.OVERLOAD.title": "让它超载",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_CORE_VALVE.pages.INITIAL.options.OVERLOAD.description": "[gold]变化[/gold]你[gold]牌组[/gold]中的[blue]2[/blue]张牌。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_CORE_VALVE.pages.INITIAL.options.OVERLOAD_LOCKED.title": "已锁定",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_CORE_VALVE.pages.INITIAL.options.OVERLOAD_LOCKED.description": "你的[gold]牌组[/gold]中没有足够可以变化的牌。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_CORE_VALVE.pages.INITIAL.options.LEAVE.title": "离开",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_CORE_VALVE.pages.INITIAL.options.LEAVE.description": "什么也不做。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_CORE_VALVE.pages.VENT.description": "你咬牙转动手轮，滚烫的蒸汽扑面而来。压力终于[green]降了下来[/green]，你也甩掉了一些多余的负担。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_CORE_VALVE.pages.OVERLOAD.description": "你反其道而行，把阀门拧到了底。管道剧烈[jitter]震动[/jitter]，一阵白光过后，你的记忆被[purple]搅成了一团[/purple]。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_CORE_VALVE.pages.LEAVE.description": "你没有去碰它。身后的警示灯还在一明一灭。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_RHODES_AIRDROP.title": "罗德岛空投",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_RHODES_AIRDROP.pages.INITIAL.description": "雪地上斜插着一只[blue]补给舱[/blue]，降落伞瘫在一旁。舱门半开，里面透出冷白色的灯光。\n\n天上，一架小型无人机正在远去——看来是友方送来的。舱里只剩两个箱子，你只来得及带走一个。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_RHODES_AIRDROP.pages.INITIAL.options.MEDKIT.title": "打开医疗箱",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_RHODES_AIRDROP.pages.INITIAL.options.MEDKIT.description": "回复最大生命值[green]30%[/green]的生命。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_RHODES_AIRDROP.pages.INITIAL.options.SUPPLIES.title": "打开药剂箱",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_RHODES_AIRDROP.pages.INITIAL.options.SUPPLIES.description": "获得[blue]2[/blue]瓶随机药水。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_RHODES_AIRDROP.pages.MEDKIT.description": "绷带、止血剂和一支[green]急救针[/green]。你简单处理了伤口，感觉好多了。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_RHODES_AIRDROP.pages.SUPPLIES.description": "箱子里整整齐齐地码着几支[blue]药剂[/blue]，标签上写着用法，还有一句手写的“[gold]保重[/gold]”。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_BLACK_SNAKE_WHISPER.title": "黑蛇的低语",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_BLACK_SNAKE_WHISPER.pages.INITIAL.description": "空旷的大厅里，黑暗在[purple][sine]缓缓蠕动[/sine][/purple]。一条巨大的黑蛇盘踞在那里，只有一只眼睛燃着[red]暗红色的火光[/red]。\n\n“你想要力量。”它的声音像是从你自己的脑海里响起，“我可以给你。只要付出一点……[jitter]代价[/jitter]。”",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_BLACK_SNAKE_WHISPER.pages.INITIAL.options.BLOOD.title": "以血为契",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_BLACK_SNAKE_WHISPER.pages.INITIAL.options.BLOOD.description": "失去[red]6[/red]点最大生命值。获得一件随机[gold]遗物[/gold]。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_BLACK_SNAKE_WHISPER.pages.INITIAL.options.BLOOD_LOCKED.title": "已锁定",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_BLACK_SNAKE_WHISPER.pages.INITIAL.options.BLOOD_LOCKED.description": "你的最大生命值太低了。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_BLACK_SNAKE_WHISPER.pages.INITIAL.options.GIFT.title": "收下馈赠",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_BLACK_SNAKE_WHISPER.pages.INITIAL.options.GIFT.description": "获得[blue]150[/blue][gold]金币[/gold]。将一张[red]矿石病[/red]加入你的[gold]牌组[/gold]。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_BLACK_SNAKE_WHISPER.pages.INITIAL.options.REFUSE.title": "拒绝",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_BLACK_SNAKE_WHISPER.pages.INITIAL.options.REFUSE.description": "什么也不做。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_BLACK_SNAKE_WHISPER.pages.BLOOD.description": "你的血滴落在地上，被黑暗[sine]吞没[/sine]。等你回过神来，手中多了一件东西。\n\n黑蛇的眼睛眯了起来，像是在笑。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_BLACK_SNAKE_WHISPER.pages.GIFT.description": "一袋沉甸甸的[gold]金币[/gold]落在你脚边。你弯腰去捡时，指尖碰到了一粒冰冷的[red]结晶[/red]。",
  "ARKNIGHTS_CHERNOBOG_EVENT_BLACK_SNAKE_WHISPER.pages.REFUSE.description": "你转身离开。黑暗里传来一声低笑：“[purple]我们还会再见的。[/purple]”"
}
